WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,850
Yeah, go to the toilet, wait a minute

2
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:06,810
No, wife, the toilet is still in the car.

3
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:08,810
It's 7:05 in the morning now

4
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:11,010
The sky didn't light up and the rain didn't stop.

5
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:12,810
Toilet on the left

6
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:15,010
Make sure no one is inside before entering.

7
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:18,010
Xiaoxiao, you didn’t sleep all night, did you?

8
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:24,610
You can ask me to get up for my shift

9
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:26,540
I slept too much

10
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:29,900
sorry sorry

11
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:33,500
It's okay. I didn't call you. Don't blame yourself.

12
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:38,760
I can't sleep, just stay awake

13
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:40,560
I'll call you when I'm sleepy

14
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:47,420
I went to the bathroom in the middle and asked the big boss to look at it for me for a while.

15
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:54,110
Please help me look at it for a while. I'll use it as the toilet.

16
00:00:54,110 --> 00:00:55,310
you go alone
